  message: "Done in PR #2198. scripts/check-id-construction compares the id's kind word with Symbol(kind=...) where both are readable in one function (factory argument, same-module helper read at its return, literal slot of a template). Acceptance re-run: on dev 2e41d7d686 it names robot, BitBake, both json_config sites and the JSX marker; on the merged tree it exits 0 with two declared holes (robot, twig), and a declaration nothing matches is itself reported. It found 33 sites; one (websocket) was the check's own error and is fixed in the check. A side that cannot be read statically is not judged; four such sites were found by running the fixture gate instead."  # dc78
